1. PROJECT PURPOSE AND BUSINESS MODEL
==================================================

AuraWed is a wedding photography photo-sharing platform for ONE professional photographer.

The photographer is the website owner and can manage multiple wedding events.

Each event can have:
- 15,000+ photos.
- 3,000+ guests.
- A unique QR code and event URL.
- Multiple wedding albums.
- HD photo downloads.
- Public read-only guest gallery access.

